---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'

const lastUpdated = '2026-11-05'
---

<Base title="Privacy" description="How Grassion collects, uses, and protects your data.">
  <article class="prose-grassion">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-[#888]">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
    <p>
      Grassion is a GitHub App that reads pull request metadata to help teams measure AI coding tool
      ROI. This policy explains what we collect and how we use it.
    </p>

    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>GitHub metadata only:</strong> PR titles, descriptions, labels, commit messages, author,
        merge status, CI check results. We do <strong>NOT</strong> fetch or store code content.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Account data:</strong> your GitHub login, email (from GitHub OAuth), and team
        membership.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Usage data:</strong> pages visited and interactions (via our own first-party analytics — no
        third-party trackers, no cookies, no IP addresses stored). We record page path, referrer, and
        anonymous session ID only. Data stays on our servers and is never sold or shared.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>What we don't collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Source code</li>
      <li>File contents</li>
      <li>Private messages or issue contents beyond what's in PR metadata</li>
      <li>Any data from repositories you haven't explicitly connected</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How we use it</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Detect AI-generated PRs and compute ROI metrics for your team</li>
      <li>Send weekly digest emails (you can opt out in settings)</li>
      <li>Provide dashboard features</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Subprocessors</h2>
    <p>We use the following third-party processors to operate Grassion:</p>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr><th>Subprocessor</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Data sent</th><th>Location</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td><strong>OpenAI</strong></td>
          <td>Generate human-readable summaries of problematic PRs (Pro feature)</td>
          <td>PR title, line-count delta, and outcome signals (reverted, CI failures, hotfix count). <strong>No diffs, no code, no emails, no author logins.</strong> We use OpenAI's API with zero-data-retention mode — API data is not used to train OpenAI models.</td>
          <td>US</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><strong>Neon</strong></td>
          <td>Postgres database</td>
          <td>All customer data</td>
          <td>US-East</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><strong>Resend</strong></td>
          <td>Transactional email delivery (digest, welcome)</td>
          <td>Recipient email, email body</td>
          <td>US</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><strong>Zoho Mail</strong></td>
          <td>Contact form and career application notifications</td>
          <td>Name, email, message</td>
          <td>India/EU</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><strong>Razorpay</strong></td>
          <td>Payment processing</td>
          <td>Billing contact, subscription metadata</td>
          <td>India</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><strong>Supabase</strong></td>
          <td>Career resume file storage (admin-only access)</td>
          <td>Uploaded PDF files</td>
          <td>US-East</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><strong>Cloudflare</strong></td>
          <td>Bot protection (Turnstile) on public forms</td>
          <td>Anonymized browser signals; no personal data</td>
          <td>US/EU</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <p>We do not sell data to anyone, ever. The full list of subprocessors is available on request.</p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Export your data: email <a href="mailto:info@grassion.com">info@grassion.com</a></li>
      <li>Delete your data: uninstall the GitHub App — your data is deleted within 24 hours. Or email us for immediate full account deletion.</li>
      <li>Access logs, DPA, security: available on request</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about privacy:
      <a href="mailto:info@grassion.com">info@grassion.com</a>
    </p>
  </article>
</Base>
